Subject: Intimation - Name Change from GGL to Gujarat Energy Ltd 

 

Dear Ma'am/Sirs (all in bcc),

 

We are writing to inform you of an important update regarding our company.
Effective from 14th May 2026, our company name has changed from Gujarat
Gas Limited to Gujarat Energy Limited. The Certificate of Incorporation
giving effect of such name change is attached for your kind consideration.

 

In view of the above, you are requested to make necessary changes in your
systems so that from now onwards, any reference to our operations/ invoice
should be in the name of Gujarat Energy Limited (GEL).

 

The contact details of GEL's employees shall remain the same and
accordingly, please feel free to reach out to the relevant points of
contact in case you require any clarification.

 

Thanks and Regards,

Nayan Simariya

SM-(P)

Gujarat Energy Ltd. 

