Subject: RE: Composite Scheme of Amalgamation and Arrangement (Scheme) -
Receipt of MCA Order approving the Scheme

 

Dear Sir

 

We are writing to formally notify you that Gujarat State Petroleum
Corporation Ltd. (GSPCL) has been amalgamated into Gujarat Gas Limited
(GGL), effective 1st May 2026. 

 

As a result of this transition, all invoicing, billing, and statutory
compliances must be updated immediately to reflect GGL's details. 

 

Please review the attached document named "Communication to Internal
Departments Vendor Customers.pdf" for comprehensive and self-explanatory
instructions regarding:

*	Updated invoicing rules and cut-off dates. 
*	GST, TDS, and credit/debit note compliances. 
*	New master data, including GGL's corporate address, PAN, TAN, CIN,
and state-specific GSTINs. 

 

We kindly request you to circulate this communication to your finance and
billing departments to ensure a seamless transition and avoid any
processing delays for your payments.

 

Thank you for your continued support and partnership.

 

Thanks and Regards,

Nayan Simariya

SM - Production

