=3DMsoNormal><span lang=3DEN-US>Dear All<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMs=
oNormal><span lang=3DEN-US><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal=
>This is with reference to the Composite Scheme of Amalgamation and Arrange=
ment amongst Gujarat State Petroleum Corporation Limited (&quot;GSPC&quot;/=
&quot;Transferor Company 1&quot;), Gujarat State Petronet Limited (&quot;GS=
PL&quot;/ &quot;Transferor Company 2&quot;), GSPC Energy Limited (&quot;GEL=
&quot;/ &quot;Transferor Company 3&quot;), Gujarat Gas Limited (&quot;GGL&q=
uot;/ &quot;Transferee Company&quot;/ &quot;Demerged Company&quot;) and GSP=
L Transmission Limited (&quot;GTL&quot;/ &quot;Resulting Company&quot;) and=
 their respective shareholders under sections 230 to 232 and other applicab=
le provisions of the Companies Act, 2013 (<b>&#8220;Scheme&#8221;</b>). The=
 draft Scheme was approved by the Board of Directors of all the above compa=
nies in their meetings held on 30<sup>th</sup> August, 2024. <o:p></o:p></p=
><p class=3DMsoNormal>Pursuant to the Scheme, the business undertakings of =
GSPC, GSPL and GEL shall be amalgamated into GGL and, concurrently, the gas=
 transmission business undertaking being the business of laying, building, =
owning, expanding and operating natural gas pipelines (&#8220;<b>Gas Transm=
ission Business Undertaking</b>&#8221;), shall be demerged into GTL.<o:p></=
o:p></p><p class=3DMsoNormal><b>We are pleased to inform that the Company h=
as received Final Order approving the Composite Scheme of Arrangement from =
the Ministry of Corporate Affairs, New Delhi (MCA) on 17<sup>th</sup> April=
, 2026. <o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=3DMsoNormal>Upon the Scheme becoming ef=
fective, the transactions of amalgamations and demerger under the Scheme sh=
all be implemented in the following order; <o:p></o:p></p><ol style=3D'marg=
in-top:0cm' start=3D1 type=3DA><li class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-left:-=
18.0pt;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo6'>GSPC shall amalgamate into GGL with effect =
from Amalgamation Appointed Date. <b><u><o:p></o:p></u></b></li><li class=
=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-left:-18.0pt;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo6'>GSPL sha=
ll amalgamate into GGL with effect from Amalgamation Appointed Date. <b><u>=
<o:p></o:p></u></b></li><li class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'margin-left:-18.0pt;=
mso-list:l3 level1 lfo6'>GEL shall amalgamate into GGL with effect from Ama=
lgamation Appointed Date.&nbsp; <b><u><o:p></o:p></u></b></li></ol><p class=
=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=3DMsoNormal>(The &#8220;Amalgama=
tion Appointed Date&#8221; i.e., the date with effect from which the accoun=
ting effect of Amalgamation shall be carried out in the books of GGL is 1<s=
up>st</sup> April, 2024.)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o=
:p></p><ol style=3D'margin-top:0cm' start=3D4 type=3DA><li class=3DMsoNorma=
l style=3D'margin-left:-18.0pt;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo6'>The gas transportat=
ion business carried on by GSPL &amp; GGL shall be demerged into GTL with e=
ffect from Demerger Appointed Date. <o:p></o:p></li></ol><p class=3DMsoNorm=
al><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=3DMsoNormal>(The &#8220;Demerged Appointed=
 Date&#8221; i.e., the date with effect from which the accounting effect of=
 the Demerger shall be carried out in the books of GGL and GTL is 1<sup>st<=
/sup> April, 2025.)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <u>&nbsp;&nbsp;</u><o:p></o:p></p><ol=
 style=3D'margin-top:0cm' start=3D5 type=3DA><li class=3DMsoNormal style=3D=
'margin-left:-18.0pt;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo6'>Further, the name of Gujarat =
Gas Limited shall be changed to Gujarat Energy Ltd. pursuant to the Scheme.=
 <o:p></o:p></li></ol><p class=3DMsoNormal>The effective date for the Schem=
e is the filing of certified copy of MCA Order with the Registrar of Compan=
ies, Ministry of Corporate Affairs.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=3DMsoNormal>Once=
 the Scheme is made effective, you will again be notified regarding the Eff=
ective Date of the Scheme. <o:p></o:p></p><p class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;<=
/o:p></p><p class=3DMsoNormal>Kindly take note of the same. <o:p></o:p></p>=
